window.bookSummaryJSON = "<strong>A town founded by witches and governed by werewolves: <strong>All three books in </strong></strong><em><strong>New York Times </strong></em><strong>bestselling author <strong>Lauren Dane</strong>’s <strong>Diablo Lake series, available together for the first time!</strong></strong><br><br><strong>Moon Struck</strong><br>Three years ago, Katie Faith Grady left Diablo Lake, heartbroken and humiliated by a man who didn’t deserve her in the first place. Her return—to help run her family’s soda fountain while her dad recovers from a heart attack—awakens the powerful magic that is her birthright. It also puts her directly in the path of a certain werewolf she’s never been able to forget.<br><br>Deputy Jace Dooley is a lot of things: alpha wolf, former bad boy, excellent mechanic. His new role of <em>neighbor </em>to the beautiful witch he’s been in love with since forever is a welcome plot twist…but Jace’s chief instinct is to protect. And a witch with as much raw power as Katie won’t be claimed on anyone’s terms but her own.<br><br><strong>Protected</strong><br>The powerful witches of Diablo Lake are taking back control. No longer will they be pawns in the town’s misguided power plays. Chosen to lead the charge, Aimee Benton can’t possibly fall for a werewolf—especially a Pack Alpha. Problem is, Mac Pembry is as irresistible as he is infuriating.<br><br>One touch of Aimee’s powerful magic and Mac immediately needs more. Not only is his witch incredibly smart, but her quiet strength and empathetic heart soothe both wolf and man. But when the Pembry pack breaks a sacred law, Aimee shuts him out. This time the wolves have gone too far. A war is brewing in Diablo Lake, and the balance of magic that sustains the town might be lost forever…<br><br><strong>Awakened</strong><br>Ruby Thorne can’t think of a better time of year to come back for good and open the health clinic she’s been planning for the last six years. This witch is exactly where she’s supposed to be. So it’s not much of a surprise that <em>he</em> comes back into her path just like he was meant to…<br><br>Damon Dooley has spent the last few years learning how to run the pack at his older brother’s right hand. And yet, Ruby has returned. Bound to one another heart and soul, both committed to what’s best for Diablo Lake, Ruby backs Damon as he pushes for much-needed change. But when something falls into Ruby’s lap and she learns the whole, terrible truth, secrets need to be spilled. How—and by whom—becomes the only question.<br><br>"; 
